<Base title="Terms of use">
  <div class="wrap stack" style="max-width:760px">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="notice">Starter terms. Have a Florida attorney review these before launch.</p>
    <p>By using Broward Spotlight you agree to these terms. Listings combine public records, information from business owners, and reviews from users. We work to keep it accurate but provide it as is, without warranties. Check important details, such as current inspection status or licensing, with the official source linked on each listing.</p>
    <p>Reviews are the opinions of the people who wrote them, not of Broward Spotlight. By submitting a review you confirm it reflects your own genuine experience as a customer and that you have no relationship with the business or its competitors. You give us a non-exclusive license to publish it.</p>
    <p>Business owners who claim a listing confirm they are authorized to represent the business and that what they add is accurate.</p>
    <p>Paid placements are labeled. Payment does not affect records, reviews or verification.</p>
    <p>Don't scrape the site, submit false information, impersonate anyone, or use the site to harass a business or a person.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
